Repair native source portability without changing game mechanics.

Mutable files belong in one XDG data directory; resources remain immutable.
The gas handler lacks its SoundFile import and names a nonexistent cough.ogg.
The existing gas_breath.ogg was introduced with the gas handler in upstream
0.8 commit 6363a81 and moved to media/Audio in 1.0.  Using that authentic
resource is a filename-mismatch repair inferred from that history, not an
upstream-confirmed rename.  Preserve the native mixer, damage and timing.

